  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-BUS0Y4JD\" id=\"h490b8bf-BUS0Y4JD\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1.支持数据</span></h2><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-7bk9PehG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MkFpoOHi\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">千川账号/计划/创意报表：</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1756428440291336\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1756428440291336</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3UL4KkgA\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">巨量升级版账号/项目/营销报表：</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1759155464901640\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1759155464901640</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4fEB6WLn\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">巨量升级版素材报表：</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1762504252446784\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1762504252446784</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PffCZy7S\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">小店随心推订单数据：</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1769951966021644\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1769951966021644</a><span style=\"color: #333333;\"></span></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-j4yvyFg9\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-PGk57MTe\" id=\"link-0\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2.库表命名</span></h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-ZkMEO1KE\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-aRNaKPge\"><col data-id=\"cba8a417-XE2G1A7Z\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/><col data-id=\"cba8a417-ZbVe4K1c\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/><col data-id=\"cba8a417-FcI28YNB\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/><col data-id=\"cba8a417-Xg29CS7V\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/><col data-id=\"cba8a417-YVQDWnKG\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/><col data-id=\"cba8a417-i7HDeaYG\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.666666666666664%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-ZQdILm51\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-AOk6QU9C\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Q6SH3Df3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-HUFhDOKS\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>表名</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-574mFZBE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-CH2JfkOf\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>数据用途</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-WHUlVGn3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-gLcoagIO\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>数据粒度</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-GXkEg00d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-8JSfmYlm\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>推送触发</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-EKbD89IO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-aQHV8OSY\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>更新频次</strong></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-ZFMAkJ24\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-p2ip0aXA\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>取数方法</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-3cf8HdVG\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-9j2a4hc7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cY4hd7MB\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">lianshan_realtime_{当周第一天日期}</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-cVRf9MgQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HVfhcmRg\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">实时账户/计划组/计划/创意小时累计报表</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ODObhkN0\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">实时账户/计划组/计划/创意日累计报表等</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-oHb9jJOM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-foUhCnhY\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">创意 × 营销展位</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hgOhFTN0\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">(creative_id × inventory)</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-NnJCK6EB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1e05lV3r\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">任一指标发生变化才推送</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-piUWG247\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">指标数据没有变化不推送</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-S0CEWQcE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A6FZrYcI\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">3min一更新</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ODm2PBUg\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">当前小时指标数据覆盖更新</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-2HOV5k3D\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FTdGkdWN\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">1.创意/计划/计划组/账号分别聚合(group by)即可</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4F01GRNe\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">2.日/周/月数据对聚合好的数据求和(sum)即可</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-krRdegGg\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">3.整点后15分钟可以获取到之前整点的稳定数据</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-28x59EK5\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">4.次日9点可以获取到前一日的持久化修正数据</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-6TiXEWky\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>库表命名规则</strong></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1PEDppRc\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">库命名：“lianshan_rds_{订阅任务ID} ”，例如lianshan_rds_1731339863784456”</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5ImIkv5M\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">表命名：“lianshan_realtime_{当周第一天日期}”，例如lianshan_realtime_20220425，按周分表</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PPqfjiz6\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-QPLB4ShO\" id=\"link-1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3.字段结构</span></h2><div class=\"table-container qz-c