据更新时间</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-rXkWMHeJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HanEs4gr\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">已落库记录覆盖更新后creat_time不变，update_time会更新至最新记录落库时间</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-SwJ0CO5l\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-7NrHkXgk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DsqjDkk6\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\">uid</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-UI9hAY6j\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VzfGuyU8\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">bigint</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-K0EanpLI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IQQNAvfF\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">数据unique id</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-KR02YeIU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-82PCc09S\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">数据同步最小粒度即creative_id × inventory粒度的同步记录唯一标识</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-6PCcPokS\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">为提升开发者数据集成的效率，数据指标平铺落库</span></p></div>",
